{"id":"torrey:dog-the","source":"torrey","name":"Dog, The","slug":"dog-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Despised by the Jews — 2Sa 3:8.","refs":[["2Sam",3,8,3,8]]},{"text":"Impatient of injury. — Pr 26:17.","refs":[["Prov",26,17,26,17]]},{"text":"Unclean. — Lu 16:21; 2Pe 2:22.","refs":[["Luke",16,21,16,21],["2Pet",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Carnivorous. — 1Ki 14:11; 2Ki 9:35,36.","refs":[["1Kgs",14,11,14,11],["2Kgs",9,35,9,35],["2Kgs",9,36,9,36]]},{"text":"Fond of blood. — 1Ki 21:19; 22:38.","refs":[["1Kgs",21,19,21,19],["1Kgs",22,38,22,38]]},{"text":"Dangerous and destructive. — Ps 22:16.","refs":[["Ps",22,16,22,16]]},{"text":"Infested cities by night — Ps 59:14,15.","refs":[["Ps",59,14,59,14],["Ps",59,15,59,15]]},{"text":"Nothing holy to be given to — Mt 7:6; 15:26.","refs":[["Matt",7,6,7,6],["Matt",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"Things torn by beasts given to — Ex 22:31.","refs":[["Exod",22,31,22,31]]},{"text":"Sacrificing of, an abomination — Isa 66:3.","refs":[["Isa",66,3,66,3]]},{"text":"Price of, not to be consecrated — De 23:18.","refs":[["Deut",23,18,23,18]]},{"text":"Employed in watching flocks. — Job 30:1.","refs":[["Job",30,1,30,1]]},{"text":"Fed with the crumbs, &c. — Mt 15:27.","refs":[["Matt",15,27,15,27]]},{"text":"Manner of, in drinking alluded to — Jdj 7:5.","refs":[["Judg",7,5,7,5]]},{"text":"Of Gentiles. — Mt 15:22,26.","refs":[["Matt",15,22,15,22],["Matt",15,26,15,26]]},{"text":"Of covetous ministers. — Isa 56:11.","refs":[["Isa",56,11,56,11]]},{"text":"Of fools. — Pr 26:11.","refs":[["Prov",26,11,26,11]]},{"text":"Of apostates. — 2Pe 2:22.","refs":[["2Pet",2,22,2,22]]},{"text":"Of persecutors. — Ps 22:16,20.","refs":[["Ps",22,16,22,16],["Ps",22,20,22,20]]},{"text":"Of obstinate sinners. — Mt 7:6; Re 22:15.","refs":[["Matt",7,6,7,6],["Rev",22,15,22,15]]},{"text":"Of false teachers. — Php 3:2.","refs":[["Phil",3,2,3,2]]},{"text":"(Dumb,) of unfaithful ministers. — Isa 56:10.","refs":[["Isa",56,10,56,10]]},{"text":"(Dead,) of the mean. — 1Sa 24:14; 2Sa 9